+	/* In CA55 clock-up mode, BL2 runs twice because CM33 firmware resets it during the
+	 * clock-up process. To avoid performing DDR initialization or retention_exit twice,
+	 * only run those steps after the CM33 core has finished booting (that is, after the
+	 * clock-up process is complete).
